# Optional operator-funded chat keys. The chat assistant works without any
# of these: it is bring-your-own-key, and a user can paste a key directly
# into the assistant's key panel instead. Set one of these only if you want
# every user of a deployment to share one key.
#
# Copy this file to .Renviron and fill in real values. Never commit .Renviron.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
